<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Total Renal started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Total Renal started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Carl Byrnes on Monday started coverage of Total Renal Care Holdings Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;TRC is a key industry consolidator with 25 percent EPS growth prospects,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Torrance, Calif., dialysis services company opened up 1/8 to 31-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
